{"4090580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Suez Canal Training Simulator", "steam_appid": 4090580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/ce57908ea6efa4486b568c0684967291.avif?t=1781549711\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras_big/ce57908ea6efa4486b568c0684967291.webp?t=1781549711 width=1560 height=650 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command container ships through tight waterways where small mistakes become big headlines. Pick contracts, load up, and steer through poorly designed canals. Grow a shipping company one risky delivery (and occasional write-off) at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c85e7a44fbeac48f6e3587532642c7ec.poster.avif?t=1781549711\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c85e7a44fbeac48f6e3587532642c7ec.webm?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c85e7a44fbeac48f6e3587532642c7ec.mp4?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain your ship</strong>: Contracts, skillful navigation, docking, and delicate balance of poorly tied down containers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; repair</strong>: Engines, rudders, stability, cargo capacity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a fleet</strong>: Unlock bigger hulls with bigger consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company HQ</strong>: Buy land, build up your HQ and earn permanent bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Locations:</strong> Discover secret ports with special stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation:</strong> Prestige vs. Infamy tiers that unlock exclusive contracts and HQ upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contraband:</strong> Carry illegal cargo, risk inspection and heavy fines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licenses</strong>: New regions and cargo types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items</strong>: Nitro .. obviously. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c2c154a91a262b2f83b3f2158397be50.poster.avif?t=1781549711\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c2c154a91a262b2f83b3f2158397be50.webm?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c2c154a91a262b2f83b3f2158397be50.mp4?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re building this in the open. Regular updates, tuning, more ships, more missions, and steady fixes. We're not bound by reality.. or realistic physics so anything goes. You want bulldozers, kraken, luxury yachts, sharks with lasers, handbrake turns, full rocket launch simulator .. ok probably not this one... but maybe the rest is doable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/88be8d2d8ef46f3b30d98298910934b1.poster.avif?t=1781549711\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/88be8d2d8ef46f3b30d98298910934b1.webm?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/88be8d2d8ef46f3b30d98298910934b1.mp4?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night and weather hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirate encounters and “canal security” incidents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship racing routes with leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig-your-own-canal  (terrain deformation).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More ships, cargos, contracts, HQ tiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command container ships through tight waterways where small mistakes become big headlines. Pick contracts, load up, and steer through poorly designed canals. Grow a shipping company one risky delivery (and occasional write-off) at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c85e7a44fbeac48f6e3587532642c7ec.poster.avif?t=1781549711\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c85e7a44fbeac48f6e3587532642c7ec.webm?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c85e7a44fbeac48f6e3587532642c7ec.mp4?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captain your ship</strong>: Contracts, skillful navigation, docking, and delicate balance of poorly tied down containers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; repair</strong>: Engines, rudders, stability, cargo capacity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a fleet</strong>: Unlock bigger hulls with bigger consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Company HQ</strong>: Buy land, build up your HQ and earn permanent bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Locations:</strong> Discover secret ports with special stores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation:</strong> Prestige vs. Infamy tiers that unlock exclusive contracts and HQ upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contraband:</strong> Carry illegal cargo, risk inspection and heavy fines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Licenses</strong>: New regions and cargo types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items</strong>: Nitro .. obviously. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c2c154a91a262b2f83b3f2158397be50.poster.avif?t=1781549711\" width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c2c154a91a262b2f83b3f2158397be50.webm?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/c2c154a91a262b2f83b3f2158397be50.mp4?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re building this in the open. Regular updates, tuning, more ships, more missions, and steady fixes. We're not bound by reality.. or realistic physics so anything goes. You want bulldozers, kraken, luxury yachts, sharks with lasers, handbrake turns, full rocket launch simulator .. ok probably not this one... but maybe the rest is doable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/88be8d2d8ef46f3b30d98298910934b1.poster.avif?t=1781549711\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/88be8d2d8ef46f3b30d98298910934b1.webm?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/extras/88be8d2d8ef46f3b30d98298910934b1.mp4?t=1781549711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night and weather hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirate encounters and “canal security” incidents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship racing routes with leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig-your-own-canal  (terrain deformation).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More ships, cargos, contracts, HQ tiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Command colossal container ships that can turn on a dime and grow a scrappy maritime shipping empire. Load containers, thread tight turns, dodge traffic, upgrade your fleet and try to arrive with at least SOME of your cargo. How hard can it be? If you block the canal, that’s on you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/e0019da5b6be7c55e5ff9e6313b0f3c85777f99a/header.jpg?t=1781549711", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090580/0ee371e0850104e5778800917b3e28aff6c6a866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781549711", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40